the central chamber continues!</span>)\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"40c0786e2679dcc2a09022bc1c21b5f1\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:130px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-The_Secret_Library_Quest_-_Devourer_of_Secrets-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:128px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"Killing The Devourer of Secrets. Make sure to keep The Books of Secrets alive.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Killing The Devourer of Secrets. Make sure to keep The Books of Secrets alive.\" height=\"128\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/The_Secret_Library_Quest_Devourer_of_Secrets_309a25.png\" style=\"\" title=\"The Secret Library Quest - Devourer of Secrets.png (676 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Killing The Devourer of Secrets. Make sure to keep The Books of Secrets alive.</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><i>There is no loot data for this creature. Please consider subtmitting loot logs for this creature using the Loot Statistics parser.</i>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Creatures\">Related Creatures</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sorcerers\">Sorcerers</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ascending%20Ferumbras\">Ascending Ferumbras</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Azerus\">Azerus</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Apprentice\">Dark Apprentice</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Mag